// The executable's icon, linked into calculator.exe by both native profiles.
//
// Ordinal 1, and it is the only icon here, because Windows shows a program's *lowest-numbered* icon resource
// wherever it shows the program itself -- Explorer, the taskbar's pinned button, a shortcut, the Apps entry.
// calculator.ico is calculator.svg (drawn after the suite icon canvas's primaries, on hue 145 deg, which no other
// application uses) rendered at 16 to 256 px by vex-suite-common's tools/Ico.java.
1 ICON "calculator.ico"
